IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-NONNUMERIC.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-SPACES   PIC X(5) VALUE SPACES.
01  WS-LETTERS  PIC X(5) VALUE "AB1CD".
01  WS-SIGNED   PIC X(5) VALUE "+1234".
01  WS-DIGITS   PIC X(5) VALUE "01234".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF WS-SPACES IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "spaces numeric" ELSE DISPLAY "spaces not-numeric" END-IF
    IF WS-LETTERS IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "letters numeric" ELSE DISPLAY "letters not-numeric" END-IF
    IF WS-SIGNED IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "signed numeric" ELSE DISPLAY "signed not-numeric" END-IF
    IF WS-DIGITS IS NUMERIC DISPLAY "digits numeric" ELSE DISPLAY "digits not-numeric" END-IF
    STOP RUN.
